      },
      "type": "TIMESTAMP"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据折扣率",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DiscPrcnt",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "整张单据的折扣百分比，与明细行折扣分开。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "整单折扣金额（本币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DiscSum",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头折扣金额，与行 DiscPrcnt 的折扣百分比和行折后价格分别使用，不重复扣减行折扣。 币种取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy，不按 DocCur 或行 Currency 给本列赋币种。 头金额在连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "整单折扣金额（外币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DiscSumFC",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头折扣金额，与行 DiscPrcnt 的折扣百分比和行折后价格分别使用，不重复扣减行折扣。 正常外币单据按本表 DocCur解释币种，此映射是字段族与单据币种规则的组合解释；不能改用行价格 Currency，跨单据须按币种分组。本币单据的 FC 列可能不适用，不能因零值或空值认定该项业务金额为零。 头金额在连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "整单折扣金额（系统币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DiscSumSy",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头折扣金额，与行 DiscPrcnt 的折扣百分比和行折后价格分别使用，不重复扣减行折扣。 币种取同一公司库 OADM.SysCurrncy，使用已保存金额，不按当前汇率重算。 头金额在连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "币种来源",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "CurSource",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据币种来源：L=本币，S=系统币，C=业务伙伴币种。C 不等于外币标识，实际单据币种读取 DocCur 并与公司本币比较。本币和系统币代码分别读取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy 和 OADM.SysCurrncy。本字段不改变各金额列已定义的 LC/FC/SC 口径，也不代替行价格 Currency。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据币种",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocCur",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据实际币种代码，可等于公司本币。CurSource 记录币种来源选择，其中 C=业务伙伴币种，不直接表示外币；外币适用性结合本字段与公司本币判断。正常外币单据的 DocTotalFC/PaidFC 按此币种解释；DocTotal/PaidToDate 的本币代码统一取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy，DocTotalSy/PaidSys 的系统币代码统一取 OADM.SysCurrncy。行 Currency 只解释行价格币种，不给所有金额列赋币种。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "过账日期",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocDate",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据的过账日期；与 TaxDate 单据日期、CreateDate 创建日期分别使用。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "TIMESTAMP"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据到期日期",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocDueDate",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "数据库参考定义为到期日期；本单据的具体界面及地区化用途仍须核实，不默认解释为付款到期日、实际交付日或收款发生日。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "TIMESTAMP"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "内部单据键",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocEntry",
      "notNull": true,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本表内部主键；关联使用该键，不能用显示单号 DocNum 代替。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "INTEGER"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据编号",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocNum",
      "notNull": true,
      "properties": {
        "description": "业务显示单号；号码系列及单据类型影响唯一性，不作为跨表唯一键。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "INTEGER"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据汇率",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocRate",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据记录的汇率；换算方向及本币/外币口径应与公司配置一致。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据开闭状态",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocStatus",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "预付款单据开闭状态，仅 O=未结、C=已结。结合 CANCELED：N/O=未取消未结，N/C=未取消已结；CANCELED=Y 表示已取消，不能仅由 DocStatus 判断取消。请求、发票、收款和抵扣需分别判断，已结本身不证明已经足额收款或全额抵扣。 API 属性 DocumentStatus 的 bost_Open/bost_Close（序号 0/1）对应开闭含义；SQL 筛选本列仍用 O/C，不用 API 名称或序号，也不扩展共享枚举的其他值。未定义值保持待核实。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据总额（本币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocTotal",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头本币总额，币种取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy；即使 DocCur 为外币也不改变本列口径。 单据总额须结合适用的税、整单折扣、费用和舍入解释，不等于不含税收入、库存成本或行金额简单合计。 连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据总额（外币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocTotalFC",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头外币总额，正常外币单据按本表 DocCur 解释币种并分组；本币单据使用 DocTotal，不能因本列为零或空就认定没有业务金额。 单据总额须结合适用的税、整单折扣、费用和舍入解释，不等于不含税收入、库存成本或行金额简单合计。 连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "单据总额（系统币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocTotalSy",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "单据头系统币总额，币种取同一公司库 OADM.SysCurrncy，不是 DocCur 或行 Currency；使用已保存金额，不按当前汇率重算。 单据总额须结合适用的税、整单折扣、费用和舍入解释，不等于不含税收入、库存成本或行金额简单合计。 连接明细后不得重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "物料/服务类型",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DocType",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "I=物料单据，S=服务单据；与 ObjType 的单据对象类型代码不同。服务行可以没有 ItemCode，应结合行 Dscription 和 AcctCode 解释，不能因缺少物料编码排除服务金额。 API 枚举 dDocument_Items/dDocument_Service（序号 0/1）仅供对照；SQL 筛选本列使用 I/S，不使用枚举名或序号。未定义值保持待核实。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR"
    },
    {
