      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DpmAmnt",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "预付款金额的本位币口径。 币种取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy，不以 DocCur 给本币金额赋币种。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "预付款金额（外币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DpmAmntFC",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "预付款金额的外币口径；使用前明确外币代码。 具体币种来源须结合预付款及其应用场景核实，本模板尚未确认；不能从 DocTotalFC 的币种映射直接推广，未确认前不跨币种合计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "预付款金额（系统币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DpmAmntSC",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "预付款金额的系统币口径。 币种取同一公司库 OADM.SysCurrncy，不按当前汇率重算已保存金额。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "已应用预付款（本位币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "DpmAppl",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "已应用预付款金额；与收付款金额及原始预付款金额区别。 币种取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy，不以 DocCur 给本币金额赋币种。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/ODPI.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
